@startuml

hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
set separator none
legend top left
+ field: has a getter and a setter (every field is private in the code)
Multiplicities come from the database foreign keys
Lines labelled with a UUID field: foreign keys the entity stores as an id
AttendeeRegistration, EventRegistration both map table event_registrations
Event, VenueEvent both map table events
VenueBooking, VenueBookingRecord both map table venue_bookings
endlegend


